Do you have a strong attitude to analysis, curiosity for managing business processes and want to put you in play? Would you like to understand how operational processes impact directly on customer satisfaction and business results and how the management of a contract represents the heart of a company’s business agility?

By entering our team "Deal to Contract" within the Commecial Finance Operation feature, you can help us rethink and optimize the billing cycle of our instrument rentals.

