• You are inspiring to deepen operational issues and propose innovative solutions;

• You have a good approach to using innovative technologies and a solid knowledge of the Office package (especially Word and Excel);

• You have good interpersonal skills, predisposition to collaboration and attitude to establish relationships of trust and productive.

What we offer

