Who we are
To healthier future drives us to innovate. Together, more than 100’000 employees across the globe are dedicated to advance science, everyday has access to healthcare today and for generations to come. Our result in more than 26 million people treated with our medicines and over 30 billion tests conducted using our Diagnostics products. We empower each other to explore new possibilities, foster creativity, and keep our ambitions high, so we can deliver life-changing healthcare solutions that make a global impact.

